      "cooked": "<p>I’m unable to login to via Safari and Chrome on iPad. I get “Internal Server Error\". I’ve validated that after I try with the iPad, with the same URL, I can login successfully on my computer. Further, I can login on my iPhone with Safari successfully.</p>\n<p>iPad Air 11” M2 with iPadOS 18.5.</p>\n<p>I’m running the free trial right now ((<a href=\"https://frappecloud.com/erpnext/signup\" class=\"inline-onebox\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Frappe Cloud</a>) to evaluate a few features (POS for iPad) before I commit. I don’t imagine it’s related, but thought I’d mention it just in case.</p>",
